<title>USA: U.S. Sept industrial output rose 0.2 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sept industrial output rose 0.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve Board</p>
<p>report of U.S. industrial production and capacity utilization,</p>
<p>seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p> Total Industrial:	 Sept    Aug   July   June  Sept96/95</p>
<p> Production, Pct Change   0.2    0.4   UNCH    0.8     3.5</p>
<p> Previous Estimates		  0.5    0.1    0.6</p>
